 (5.7%)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02009;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003; &#x0003e;6 hours </td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">61</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1 (1.6%)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02009;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Coagulopathy<sup>c</sup></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02009;</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02009;</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.004<sup>b</sup></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003; Yes </td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">67</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">13 (19.4%)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02009;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003; No</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">345</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">25 (7.3%)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02009;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Hypotension<sup>c</sup></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02009;</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02009;</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.000<sup>b</sup></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003; Yes </td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">74</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">16 (21.6%) </td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02009;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003; No </td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">338</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">22 (6.5%)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02009;</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>PEDH: progressive epidural hematoma; GCS: Glasgow Coma Score; CT: computerized tomography.</p></fn><fn><p><sup>a</sup><italic>&#x003c7;</italic><sup>2</sup> test <italic>P</italic> &#x0003c; 0